Subject: Backport upstream PHP libxml2 2.12-2.15 and ICU 70+ compatibility fixes to PHP 7.0
Policy-Class: P2-Package
Rationale: Backport upstream php/php-src libxml2 2.12/2.13/2.14 fixes (8a95e616b9 GH-12702, 0a39890c96, 4fe821311c, 903fcb45c3): include libxml/parser.h in php_libxml.h, remove libxml2-private ATTRIBUTE_UNUSED in ext/libxml/libxml.c, update xmlGetLastError()/xmlStructuredErrorFunc to const xmlError *, replace deprecated libxml/SAX.h with libxml/xmlsave.h and libxml/encoding.h, and use xmlBufferContent() in ext/xmlwriter; plus ICU 68+/70+ boolean literals and BreakIterator::operator== bool return type so PHP 7.0 builds cleanly against libxml2 2.15 and ICU 79.
Upstream-Status: Backport (upstream PHP 7.4/8.x libxml2 2.12-2.14 and ICU 70 compatibility fixes)
Fil-C-Origin-Commits: none
Origin-Kind: backport
Origin-Project: php/php-src

